 927:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h **** /**
 928:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \brief   Instruction Synchronization Barrier
 929:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Instruction Synchronization Barrier flushes the pipeline in the processor,
 930:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****            so that all instructions following the ISB are fetched from cache or memory,
 931:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****            after the instruction has been completed.
